<title>USA: Pflugerville, Texas, won by Griffin Kubik.</title>
<headline>Pflugerville, Texas, won by Griffin Kubik.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Griffin Kubik said it won $3 million of Pflugerville, Texas, general obligation Series 1996 A bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.3405 percent.</p>
</text>
